1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:04,000
Hesitating or stalling under load?
It's not always the fuel pump.

2
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:09,000
Sluggish on hills, bogging when you merge,
or stalling only under real load.

3
00:00:09,000 --> 00:00:16,000
A clogged fuel filter can point to fuel
starving the engine when it needs more.

4
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:22,000
Leave it long enough and the fuel pump
straining against it can wear out early too.

5
00:00:22,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Don't guess — a highway stall is the
wrong place to find out.

6
00:00:26,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Worth checking before it strands you.
Stop by — Nick's Tire & Auto.
